 time, in his dis­\ncretion, such lands, buildings, or interests in land or other \nproperty now owned by the United States and within the \nterritorial lim its o f Puerto R ico as in his opinion are no \nlonger needed fo r purposes o f the United States; and \nW HEREAS the island w ithin the territorial lim its o f \nPuerto R ico known as Desecheo Island, heretofore reserved","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_7636.txt","sha256":"2620a16a390b3fe071ac53c92ac182b409c5aaf950419f91c0c6cfddeb3bb5e5","source":{"line":12,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"d0ccd7d49c98f0e1ec954189504e650441b64e9c19ff672ab5558ed47d8aa14c"}}]}
